Inner Circle is a personal community preset for Hermes Desktop.
It is not affiliated with Nous Research or xAI.

The visual treatment grew from Thomas Bekkers' Hermes Bot Kit (MIT):
https://github.com/thomasbek3/hermes-bot-kit
The applicable copyright and permission notice is retained in LICENSE.
Selected Bubble Mode and Task Dock sources are bundled from the reviewed
revision; adaptations are described in vendor/README.md.

Hermes Desktop provides the SDK, native profiles, conversations and pane layout:
https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent

The demo shows character profile artwork and folder labels from the customized
setup, shared at the owner's request, with synthetic conversation text.
It contains no production conversations, profile configuration or credentials.
See demo/ASSETS.md for character portrait credits.
